      "problem": "The vector $a$ has magnitude $5,$ the vector $b$ has magnitude $2,$ and $a∥b.$ Find $a\\times b.$",
      "worked_solution": "Suppose $a$ and $b$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $a\\times b=0$ if and only if $a∥b.$\n\nTherefore, $a\\times b=0.$",
