      "problem": "The vector $z$ has magnitude $2.$ What is $z\\times z?$",
      "worked_solution": "Suppose $a$ and $b$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $a\\times b=0$ if and only if $a∥b.$\n\nNotice that any vector is parallel to itself. So, we have $z∥z.$\n\nTherefore, $z\\times z=0.$",
